edits.content:
Example merge behavior for overlapping or touching intervals:

Input segments:

```json
{
  "segments": [
    {"start": 10, "end": 20},
    {"start": 18, "end": 25},
    {"start": 25, "end": 30}
  ]
}
```

Normalized output:

```json
{
  "segments": [
    {"start": 10, "end": 30, "duration": 20}
  ],
  "total_segments": 1,
  "total_duration_seconds": 20
}
```

